      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REDBACK JACK (1) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by a nose at this track in a handy 17.16 beating Melissa's Flying. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Sure to prove hard to beat. I'M THE PROBLEM (2) broke a string of placings finishing in the money three on end before a last start eighth (30.61) at Rockhampton. Form at the trip sound including two wins. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Shapes as one to consider. SPICY VIKING (4) is mixing form lately, finishing out of the placings last time at this track but was a Grade 5 winner two back at Sale. Has the ability and expected to do much better. GEORGIA HEAT (5) boasts a solid strike-rate over this track and distance.",
